<section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container about">
    <div class="about__intro reveal">
      <span class="section__eyebrow">About Nova</span>
      <h2 class="section__title" id="about-title">A proving ground for Ontario's next business leaders</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about__body reveal">
      <p>
        Nova is a high school business case competition built to give students
        a taste of real strategic decision-making. Teams tackle authentic
        business problems under time pressure, then defend their thinking in
        front of a panel of judges &mdash; the same skills that separate good
        analysts from great ones.
      </p>
      <p>
        We created Nova because too few students get the chance to test
        themselves on problems that don't have a tidy answer in the back of a
        textbook. Whether you're a first-time competitor or a seasoned case
        cracker, Nova is designed to stretch how you think, communicate, and
        perform when it counts.
      </p>
      <p>
        No prior experience required. Just curiosity, a team of four, and the
        drive to rise to the moment.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="about__stats reveal" aria-label="Key facts">
      <li class="card about__stat">
        <span class="about__stat-num">2</span>
        <span class="about__stat-word">Competitive rounds</span>
      </li>
      <li class="card about__stat">
        <span class="about__stat-num">4</span>
        <span class="about__stat-word">Students per team</span>
      </li>
      <li class="card about__stat">
        <span class="about__stat-num">9&ndash;12</span>
        <span class="about__stat-word">Open to all grades</span>
      </li>
      <li class="card about__stat">
        <span class="about__stat-num">1</span>
        <span class="about__stat-word">Unforgettable day</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
  }
  .about__body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .about__body {
    font-size: 1.075rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 70ch;
  }
  .about__stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .about__stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
  }
  .about__stat-num {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 2.8rem);
    color: var(--steel-bright);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .about__stat-word {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .about__stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  }
</style>
